node_modules/
out/
# Kokoro TTS model files (fetched by analysis/tts_kokoro.py, ~340 MB)
analysis/models/
__pycache__/
# large intermediates: the committed soundtrack is public/audio/mix.mp3
public/audio/mix.wav
public/audio/voiceover.wav
# The repo root ignores lib/ and data/ (Python habits). This project keeps code in src/lib and timings in public/data:
# without these two lines a clone cannot run (v1 lost both directories this way, found 7 Oct).
!src/lib/
!public/data/
# the 3D ports keep one real desk snapshot next to their code (root rule data/ would drop it)
!src/three/data/
# v2 audio intermediates (rebuilt by analysis/vo_v2.py + analysis/mix_v2.py); the video plays public/audio/mix_v2.mp3
public/audio/mix_v2.wav
public/audio/voiceover.wav
# captures not used by the cut (re-capture: node scripts/capture-flow.mjs, see public/web/README.md)
public/web/stills/*
!public/web/stills/submit-agent-top.jpg
public/web/clips/analysts.*
public/web/clips/home-mobile.*
public/web/clips/status.*
public/web/clips/submit-agent.*
